85 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Rapid Construction stands as a testament to the determination and vision of its founders, Mr. Anwar Abbajumma and Mr. Shamim Abbajumma. With over 150 years of family history in Mumbai, their journey began with humble origins. Following their father's passing in 1968, Mr Anwar supported the family through cloth sales, brick supplies, and property brokerage. In 1971, his marriage fueled greater ambition, and alongside Shamim, they launched Rajdeep Road Lines, a thriving logistics venture until 1984. That same year, they laid the foundation for the Rapid Construction Empire.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

